{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/a982767bc9475fbadcab08f75a9852ac.avif?t=1759930555\" width=1080 height=206 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run in <strong>BARDA</strong> is a fight against chaos. Loot pours in, monsters close in, and the only thing standing between you and disaster\u2026 is how you pack your bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/4122cb5230d8a0c39fc9654a013ca2fc.poster.avif?t=1759930555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/4122cb5230d8a0c39fc9654a013ca2fc.webm?t=1759930555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/4122cb5230d8a0c39fc9654a013ca2fc.mp4?t=1759930555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/66e89ec49547c16cf83cec115cfd3a89.avif?t=1759930555\" width=1080 height=206 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless maps, shifting dangers, no two journeys the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run forces impossible choices: do you carry one huge sword\u2026 or three lifesaving potions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong placement, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664320/extras/f35badfaf82e20c5b594dd81104e7017.poster.avif?t=1759930555\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati